  "priorExpiration": "2017-02-25",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Saf-C 1502.02 Granting the Waiver.\n\n(a) The commissioner shall waive a restoration fee upon receipt of a written request from a person, along with evidence of one or more of the items listed in Saf-C 1502.01.\n\n(b) The commissioner shall inform the bureau of financial responsibility, to which the fees are paid, that a licensee has been granted a waiver of the restoration fee.\n\nSource. #5346, eff 3-10-92; ss by #6702, eff 3-3-98, EXPIRED: 3-3-06\n\nNew. #8785, eff 1-3-07, EXPIRED: 1-3-15\n\nNew. #11172, INTERIM, eff 8-29-16, EXPIRED: 2-25-17\n\nNew. #12212, eff 6-16-17",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/saf-c1500.html"
